{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/son0SUkpZS2P6KPe6gTBAQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:57.881509+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/son0SUkpZS2P6KPe6gTBAQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAWvjEibmvwcwVzAbW6sH6RXWUWgFl3agxglWTQGUL125BaibBMDk3T4qQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>上海交通大学上海高级金融学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2026级全日制金融硕士推免招生夏令营通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>申报类别</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>学位类型</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>专业名称及编号</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><strong><span>学制</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>授课语言</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>025100金融</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>两年</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><span>英语</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（简称“高金/SAIF”）全日制金融硕士项目（简称“MF”）2026级推荐免试研究生夏令营将于2025年夏季举办。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2026级MF项目的招生与培养分为：</span><strong><span>金融硕士金融方向</span></strong><strong><span>（MF-General Track）</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>金融硕士金融科技方向（MF-FinTech Track）</span></strong><span>。两个方向申请流程一致，同学只可选择其一进行申请。2026级拟录取学生将由推免生和统考生构成，具体拟录取名额请关注交大研招网公布的数据。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>项目介绍 SAIF MF</span></span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>金融硕士项目作为上海交通大学上海高级金融学院的旗舰项目，自2009年创立以来，一直以</span><span><strong><span>专业化、国际化、市场化</span></strong></span><span>为办学特色，项目采用两年全日制，全英文教学模式，并直接引进世界级名校的一流师资。毕业生平均起薪连年逆势增长，就业率始终保持在100%。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在2025年英国《金融时报》金融硕士排名中，交大高金金融硕士项目再创新高，跃升至</span><strong><span>全球第七</span></strong><span>，其中职业发展服务</span><strong><span>稳居亚洲第一</span></strong><span>。项目于2017年起，连续三届</span><strong><span>蝉联亚洲第一</span></strong><span>，并三度跻身全球前十。目前，SAIF MF被视为亚洲最负盛名的金融项目之一。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>申请要求  Who Can Apply</span></span><strong></strong></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>1</span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em><span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康； </span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>2</span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录； </span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>3</span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em><span><span>本科三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业生），不限专业，对金融/金融科技具有极强兴趣，具备较强的数理基础及分析能力，鼓励理工农医同学跨专业申请； </span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>4</span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em><span><span>能获得本科院校的推免研究生资格；</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>5</span></strong></em></span><span><em><strong></strong></em><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩优秀，英语能力优异（CET6≥425/TOEFL≥90/IELTS≥6.0）。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>夏令营活动安排 Event Calendar</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><b><i><span>活动时间</span></i></b></p></section><section><p><span>2025年7月11-13日 </span></p></section><section><p><b><i><span><br/></span></i></b></p><p><b><i><span>活动地点</span></i></b></p></section><section><p><span>交大高金</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><em><span>     *以上活动如有任何时间及形式变动，SAIF MF将另作通知。</span></em></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>报名方式 Application Access</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>访问链接，开启网申</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAtr6UxpZibJnZ95ibCDgyN8a9wy46TsHndsjuicNGD5POamjPjYdib7MOSg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><em><span><span>https://apply.saif.sjtu.edu.cn/user/login/saif/42</span></span></em></p></section></section><section><p><em><span><br/></span></em></p><p><span><em><span>*获得交大高金金融硕士入营资格的同学，需登录上海交通大学研究生网申系统（ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl）进行填报，报名截止时间为7月5日，具体填写要求请查看邮件通知。</span></em></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>申请材料 Application Materials</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>盖章申请表、个人信息、教育背景、实践经历、2封推荐信、英语成绩、及其他材料（包含文书、个人视频/图片、科研经历、荣誉奖励等）。请按照学院及校系统相关要求如实填写。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>选拔考核流程 Application Process</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><b><i><span>资格审查</span></i></b></p></section><section><p><span>招生工作小组按照学术背景、专业能力、英语水平、实习实践、综合能力等维度择优确定入营名单，将以电子邮件和微信形式于复试前通知入围学生。请确保在学院报名系统中填写的邮箱和手机号码正确，并保持联系方式畅通。入营名单与考核结果将在交大研院与学院官网进行公示。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><b><i><span>考核内容</span></i></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAxbZWX0myZuEGm50AwuVp6ZEpg7NGtBq4SGM9FXYHHW9WccoOaeuibUw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><b><i><span>激励政策</span></i></b></p></section><section><p><span>选拔活动中表现优秀者将获得明星营员身份，明星营员如获得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格，申请我院并符合我校推免生招生条件，学院将根据接收规模从高分到低分择优录取，额满为止。2026级推免预录取学生将实现100%奖学金覆盖。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>其他说明 Declaration</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>考生填报的所有信息和提供的辅助材料必须真实有效，如弄虚作假将取消入围资格，对于已获得明星营员身份的学生，取消预录取资格，并通报所在学校。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本办法由高金学院负责解释，其他条款参照《上海交通大学2026年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生实施办法》执行。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p></section><section><p><em><span>Contact Us</span></em></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>Tel：021-62934968</span></p><p><span>Email：mf.admissions@saif.sjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>微信: SAIF-MF</span></p><p><span>LinkedIn：SAIF MF</span></p><p><span>Ins：@SAIF_MF_</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZPtdzESiawhdMHyNfDvj0a36SiaN499NjK0BKean9ibV1T8rYe2gLG8OTSjeCB1NesY09JLKujB7DqpO8DGu4HFxw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请高金MF 与优秀为伍</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAoMP2JPzcl4nsWoicrhAAgtIYvHMOHO6Xx3vF92bOibObDBCDULu3k9icA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><em><span>https://apply.saif.sjtu.edu.cn/user/login/saif/42</span></em></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZPtdzESiawhdMHyNfDvj0a36SiaN499NjK0BKean9ibV1T8rYe2gLG8OTSjeCB1NesY09JLKujB7DqpO8DGu4HFxw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业方向</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><em><span>Program Tracks</span></em></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>金融硕士金融方向（MF-General Track）：</span></strong></em></span><span>金融方向自2009年开创，课程设计框架对标美国麻省理工学院，结合国内外金融市场发展，不断对课程进行优化与改良。以经典、硬核、与时俱进著称的金融方向，覆盖财务会计、金融市场、衍生品等课程，毕业生去向包括投行与咨询、投资、投研、销售交易等方向。</span><strong><span>我们欢迎金融经管，有实习经验，中英文交流能力等软技能比较强的同学报名；金融方向也特别欢迎各类理工科，医科背景，想转金融方向的优秀人才报考。</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>金融硕士金融科技方向（MF-FinTech Track）：</span></strong></em></span><span>课程设置专注于金融、机器学习和计算机技术和应用三个方面。金融科技方向 (MF-FinTech Track) 专业</span><strong><span>仅招收有很强数理和计算机背景的学生，特别是以下本科专业：数学，应用数学，统计和数据科学，自动化，计算机和人工智能，金融工程，数理经济，物理等；经济、金融专业申请金融科技方向，需要辅修上述的专业作为第二专业或额外提供很强数理背景材料。</span></strong><span>曾在全国中学生奥林匹克数、理、计算机竞赛或国际大学生数学、计算机和建模竞赛获奖的同学会更具申请与录取优势。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>交大高金金融硕士</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><em><span>About SAIF MF</span></em></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>金融硕士(Master of Finance，简称 MF)项目作为上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（交大高金/SAIF）的旗舰项目，自2009年创立以来，一直以</span><span><strong><span>专业化、国际化、市场化</span></strong></span><span>为办学特色，项目采用两年全日制，全英文教学模式，并直接引进世界级名校的一流师资。毕业生平均起薪连年逆势增长，就业率始终保持在100%。交大高金金融硕士项目设置金融（MF-General）与金融科技（MF-FinTech）两大培养方向，拥有前沿尖端的课程设置、国际视野的教学结构、密切深度的业界实践，与国际全面接轨。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>在2025年英国《金融时报》金融硕士排名中，交大高金金融硕士项目再创新高，跃升至全球第七，其中职业发展服务稳居亚洲第一。项目于2017年起，连续三届蝉联亚洲第一，并三度跻身全球前十。目前，SAIF MF被视为亚洲最负盛名的金融项目之一。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><em><strong><span>一起加入全球Top金融项目！</span></strong></em></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/6LiaEAplUaanFeS6TE1DdZGZuJWyRJuLXmwkx4xxU6WHqefM9gibnBteEWaycUKDHsDasxM6nNJZfTtoql8wxHQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推荐阅读</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NDQ3NjA1MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2921132749137346565#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NDQ3NjA1MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2921132749137346565#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAP13U3stomZJCCp8QODn1zrgDKWv1AGO5fsgCz0u1wuInapDfPiaWbkw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></a></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>合集 | 高金MF学生校友故事</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>▲ 点击图片查看原文</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZGrOHOwfWiaeuxlnMbEECPIwlKz1iaalM78vXT2Fh3l2N4s73S7YP7iamIaBXrz313RvxribES9kI6BNicNzTufqroA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点“阅读原文”，开启申请</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"c379301d379d791b48206e2e6469c7fa53e9ed0eed8bb04ddadaac85d863435e","textLength":2589,"sourceSha256":"3ed55dae31028377cfddd988ddac68d1058216ea64f17e5cdfdbe76948057199","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a5128cef12cfcc58b079","title":"2025年上海交通大学上海高级金融学院2026级全日制金融硕士推免招生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:57.881509+00:00"}
